{"id":"predlozhenie","lemma":"предложение","pos":"noun","rank":496,"glosses":["offer","suggestion, proposal (also: marriage proposal), proposition","supply"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/7b/Ru-%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B4%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%B6%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B4%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%B6%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"предложения","plural":"предложения"},"examples":[{"text":"Это моё последнее предложение.","en":"It's my last offer.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"my","l":"мой"},{"g":"last, latest, recent","l":"последний"},null]},{"text":"Вы за или против этого предложения?","en":"Are you for or against the proposal?","words":[{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},{"g":"behind / for"},{"g":"or"},{"g":"against"},null,null]},{"text":"Спасибо за предложение.","en":"Thanks for the offer.","words":[{"g":"thank you, thanks"},{"g":"behind / for"},null]},{"text":"Вы можете понять смысл этого предложения?","en":"Can you understand the meaning of this sentence?","words":[{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"to understand"},{"g":"sense, meaning"},null,null]},{"text":"Я хочу сделать тебе одно предложение.","en":"I want to make you an offer.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"to make, to do"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"ты"},null,null]}]}